I've decided to import React to fix the "Cannot find namespace 'React'" error. After reviewing the changes, it seems best to add `import React from 'react';` to the beginning of `types.ts`. This resolves the core namespace issue in one fell swoop. The revised file is ready, and the import addresses the issue directly. I have verified that this fixes the problem and the error is now resolved.


